    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PropertyTeam are delighted to present 140 Glencarrig, an exceptional detached family home extending to approximately 300 sq.m., offering an impressive combination of contemporary design, generous proportions and outstanding energy efficiency (B rated) in one of Sutton's most sought-after residential locations which is in walking distance to Sutton village, DART station and International school..\r\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, this unique split-level home is flooded with natural light and features spacious accommodation throughout, complemented by high-specification finishes and includes innovative energy-saving features.\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the quality and thoughtful layout are immediately apparent. The entrance level is centred around a luxurious master suite with a private en-suite, while a welcoming sitting room with double doors opening into a versatile study or playroom provides the perfect balance of family and entertaining space. A guest W.C. completes this floor.\r\nThe heart of the home is found on the lower level, where an impressive 42 sq.m. (approx) kitchen creates a stunning open-plan living and dining space. A beautiful winter garden extends naturally from the kitchen, offering an inviting year-round space to relax while enjoying views of the garden. This level also includes a bathroom, a generous storage room. \r\nThe upper floor offers three further spacious double bedrooms, each designed with comfort and practicality in mind, together with a beautifully appointed family bathroom.\r\nThroughout the home, every detail has been carefully considered to maximise comfort, efficiency and everyday living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n•\tDetached family home extending to approx. 300 sq.m.\r\n•\tFour generously proportioned double bedrooms\r\n•\tMaster bedroom with en-suite\r\n•\tStunning 42 sq.m. open-plan kitchen\r\n•\tWinter garden adjoining the kitchen\r\n•\tSeparate sitting room with double doors to study/playroom\r\n•\tThree bathrooms including guest W.C.\r\n•\tUnderfloor heating throughout\r\n•\tMechanical Ventilation with Heat Recovery (MVHR) system\r\n•\tTriple-glazed windows\r\n•\tIndividual thermostatic temperature control in every room\r\n•\tContemporary split-level architectural design"
      },
